DTSTAMP:20261030T164555Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T210000
SUMMARY:MUG Zürich — How to Truly Stop AI Hallucinations
LOCATION:Zurich (venue to be announced)
DESCRIPTION:Two talks from Helvetia Insurance engineers: why factual errors
  in generative AI apps usually come from weak retrieval design rather than
  the model — covering semantic chunking\, metadata filtering\, hybrid se
 arch\, reranking and output guardrails — and a second session on the ben
 efits and risks of AI-assisted development.\n\nOrganiser: Zürich MongoDB 
 User Group\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/
 mongodb-user-group-zurich-hallucinations-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/mongodb-user-group-zurich-hallucinati
 ons-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
