 I-generated code: what architects should still decide themselves when mach
 ines write the implementation. Live stream plus a few on-site seats at ERN
 I.\n\nOrganiser: Software Architecture and Project Design Zurich\n\nDetail
 s and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/software-architectur
 e-residuality-ai-zurich-2026/
