SUMMARY:AI Safety: Building Trustworthy AI in the Real World
LOCATION:Zalando\, Prime Tower\, Hardstrasse 201\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:Four speakers from Google\, AWS\, Unique and Systematic-X on ke
