 ight and red-teaming fit\, and how to ship fast without losing accountabil
 ity.\n\nOrganiser: Elevate Tech: Women and Minorities in AI\, Tech\, and S
 cience\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai-s
 afety-trustworthy-ai-zurich-2026/
